OL,3,AApple to replace iPhone Duos affected
OL,4,Aby screen problem
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Duo's launch, which attracted
OL,7,Fcrowds at Apple stores around the world
OL,8,Flast week, is an attempt to
OL,9,Freinvigorate the brand's device range
OL,10,Fand challenge the foldable phones made
OL,11,Fby rivals.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/19
