OL,3,A6 Music Festival 2027 heads to
OL,4,ANewcastle
OL,5,
OL,6,FBBC Radio 6 Music has announced the
OL,7,F2027 edition of its annual festival
OL,8,Fwill take place in Newcastle.
OL,10,FAfter four years in Greater Manchester,
OL,11,Fthe festival will take place across
OL,12,FNewcastle's independent and grassroots
OL,13,Fvenues in March with five days of
OL,14,Fperformances and DJ sets.
OL,16,FTyneside last hosted the festival in
OL,17,F2015 but principal advisor for events
OL,18,Fand culture at Newcastle City Council,
OL,19,FJim Mawdsley, said since then
OL,20,F"Newcastle has become a true music
OL,21,Fcity".
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/19
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
