OL,3,ANeil Young sues Trump campaign again
OL,4,Afor playing Rockin' in the Free World
OL,5,Aat rally
OL,6,
OL,7,FRock veteran Neil Young has filed a
OL,8,F$10m lawsuit against a fundraising
OL,9,Fcommittee that supports US President
OL,10,FDonald Trump, citing "unauthorised" use
OL,11,Fof his 1989 song Rockin' in the Free
OL,12,FWorld.
OL,14,FThe Canadian-American star alleges that
OL,15,Fthe Trump 47 Committee infringed on his
OL,16,Fcopyright when it played the song
OL,17,Fbefore Trump took the stage at a 12
OL,18,FOctober rally in Ohio. Playing the song
OL,19,Famounts to an "unauthorised public
OL,20,Fperformance", the lawsuit says.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/19
